{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify theme developer. Generate a responsive, pixel-perfect, custom section for a "Case Study Grid" component. The design must precisely mirror the card layout, spacing, and styling details provided below while automatically inheriting the current Shopify theme's global typography, primary max-width (e.g., 1200px), and core button outline styles to ensure a native look.
    
    ---
    
    ### 1. GRID SECTION ARCHITECTURE
    
    - The section must be built as a responsive multi-column grid layout.
    - Desktop: 3 columns per row (`grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)`).
    - Tablet/Mobile: Collapses cleanly to 1 column per row.
    - Spacing: Use uniform gaps between cards (around 24px-32px grid-gap).
    
    ---
    
    ### 2. CARD COMPONENT STRUCTURE (REPEATABLE BLOCKS)
    
    Each grid card is a self-contained white box block with a clean, high-end editorial feel. Replicate these exact vertical zones inside every card:
    
    #### ZONE 1: CARD CONTAINER STYLING
    - Background: Pure white (`#ffffff`).
    - Border: Very subtle, thin light-grey border (1px solid `#e2e8f0` or similar theme variant).
    - Border Radius: Crisp rounded corners (border-radius: 16px).
    - Padding: Generous internal card padding (around 24px-32px).
    - Box Shadow: None, or an extremely minimal, flat aesthetic.
    
    #### ZONE 2: HEADER (Flex Row)
    - Layout: A horizontal flex row aligning a brand image asset next to the text info block.
    - Brand Image Setting: Must include a dynamic Shopify image upload setting (`type: image_picker`). The output must be rendered as a small square container (around 48px to 60px), with a border-radius of 12px, a thin light grey border, and object-fit: contain.
    - Text Stack (positioned immediately to the right of the brand image):
      - Case Study Title: Bold, prominent, dark navy/slate text (e.g., "Cole Haan Japan").
      - Category Meta-text: Tiny, muted grey text directly underneath the title (e.g., "Premium Footwear & Accessories").
    
    #### ZONE 3: SUB-HEADER TAG
    - Placed directly below the main header row with a small top margin.
    - Content: Short phrase text (e.g., "Multiple formats" or "Multiple locations").
    - Styling: Deep navy/blue tone, small font size, semi-bold weight.
    
    #### ZONE 4: DIVIDER LINE
    - A thin, full-width horizontal divider line (`border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9`) separating the header zone from the summary paragraph.
    
    #### ZONE 5: SUMMARY TEXT PARAGRAPH
    - Content: A short, 2-3 sentence overview paragraph describing the client challenge.
    - Styling: Muted grey text color, comfortable line-height, text truncation rule (e.g., `line-clamp: 3` or an ellipsis if the text overflows past 3 lines to maintain uniform card heights).
    
    #### ZONE 6: KEY RESULTS LIST
    - Label: An uppercase, small, semi-bold section heading titled "KEY RESULTS" in a muted grey tone.
    - List items: 3 bullet points with custom iconography. Replace standard bullet discs with a small, light green upwards-trending arrow icon (`↗`).
    - Text Styling: Muted slate grey text, left-aligned, comfortable line-height.
    
    #### ZONE 7: FOOTER & OUTLINE BUTTON
    - Positioned at the absolute bottom of the card block.
    - Button Style: Transparent background with a crisp, thin navy/dark grey outline border. 
    - Content: Text "View Details" followed by a right-facing arrow (→).
    - Alignment: Centered or full-width inside the card bounds, matching the theme's core outline button padding.
    
    ---
    
    ### 3. DESIGN & BRAND ALIGNMENT RULES
    
    - Typography: Do NOT hardcode font families. Inherit the Shopify theme's heading font for titles/labels and the theme's body font for paragraphs and list descriptions.
    - Sizing & Max-Width: Constrain the overall grid wrapper to your theme’s global max-width (`var(--page-width)`). Ensure the section centers beautifully on large viewports.
    - Repeatable Logic: Ensure this section uses repeatable blocks (`"type": "case_study_card"`) in its schema so users can easily hit "Add block" in the Shopify Customizer to stack rows of 3 indefinitely.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-case-study-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__brand-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__brand-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__brand-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__brand-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__header-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-grow: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--heading-font-family);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--text-font-family);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--text-font-family);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1e40af;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: #f1f5f9;
    border: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__summary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--text-font-family);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #64748b;
    margin: 0;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__results-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__results-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--text-font-family);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__results-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__results-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--text-font-family);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #475569;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #10b981;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: #1e293b;
    border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: var(--button-border-radius);
    font-family: var(--text-font-family);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: #94a3b8;
    background-color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card__button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<case-study-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-case-study-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-case-study-card__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-case-study-card__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-case-study-card__brand-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.brand_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.brand_image | image_url: width: 120 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.brand_image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="56"
            height="56"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-case-study-card__brand-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="ai-case-study-card__header-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-case-study-card__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.category != blank %}
          <p class="ai-case-study-card__category-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.category }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.tag != blank %}
      <p class="ai-case-study-card__tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tag }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    <hr class="ai-case-study-card__divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}">

    {% if block.settings.summary != blank %}
      <p class="ai-case-study-card__summary-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.summary }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-case-study-card__results-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <p class="ai-case-study-card__results-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">KEY RESULTS</p>
      <ul class="ai-case-study-card__results-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.result_1 != blank %}
          <li class="ai-case-study-card__results-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <span class="ai-case-study-card__results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">↗</span>
            <span>{{ block.settings.result_1 }}</span>
          </li>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.result_2 != blank %}
          <li class="ai-case-study-card__results-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <span class="ai-case-study-card__results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">↗</span>
            <span>{{ block.settings.result_2 }}</span>
          </li>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.result_3 != blank %}
          <li class="ai-case-study-card__results-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <span class="ai-case-study-card__results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">↗</span>
            <span>{{ block.settings.result_3 }}</span>
          </li>
        {% endif %}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-case-study-card__footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <a
        href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
        class="ai-case-study-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
      >
        <span>{{ block.settings.button_text }}</span>
        <span class="ai-case-study-card__button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</case-study-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CaseStudyCard{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.style.display = 'block';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('case-study-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CaseStudyCard{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Case study card",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Brand"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "brand_image",
      "label": "Brand logo"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Client name",
      "default": "Cole Haan Japan"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "category",
      "label": "Category",
      "default": "Premium Footwear & Accessories"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Details"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tag",
      "label": "Tag",
      "default": "Multiple formats"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "summary",
      "label": "Summary",
      "default": "Cole Haan Japan partnered with Flow Solutions to optimize their omnichannel retail experience across multiple store formats and digital touchpoints."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Key results"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "result_1",
      "label": "Result 1",
      "default": "35% increase in conversion rate"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "result_2",
      "label": "Result 2",
      "default": "50% reduction in checkout time"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "result_3",
      "label": "Result 3",
      "default": "Seamless integration across 12 locations"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Button"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_text",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "View Details"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "desktop_width_percent",
      "label": "Desktop width",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 100
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Case study card"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
